<body lang="zh-TW" link="blue" vlink="purple" style='tab-interval: .5in'>
<div class="WordSection1">
<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellpadding="0" style="width: 749.333px; background: white; border: 1pt solid #e5e5e5;">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 173px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9pt 0.75pt 3.75pt 35.25pt; height: 173px; width: 701.333px;">
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; color: #086db6;"><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/f9712e60-0f4f-11ec-b99d-71fb5839283b.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" /></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; color: #086db6;">請驗證您的電子郵件</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30pt 0.75pt 27.75pt; height: 17px; width: 701.333px;">
<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center" /></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 21px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 21px; width: 701.333px;" id="emailMainDiv">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><span style="color: #666666;"> {!Contact.FirstName}，歡迎使用 {!Contact.LastName},</span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="color: #666666;"><b></b></span></b></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 64px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 64px; width: 701.333px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">感謝您註冊開發人員專區 Premier 帳戶。</span><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">如果您尚未 Intel 簽訂企業保密協議（CNDA），則可能需要至多 10 個工作天來審核您的 Premier 帳戶申請。您將在 3 個工作天內收到狀態更新。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">在您 Premier 帳戶申請審核的同時，您能以 Standard 使用者的身分立即存取 Intel 的開發人員專區。</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">請保留此封電子郵件以供日後參考。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 42px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 42px; width: 701.333px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><b>使用者名稱：</b></b> {!Contact.Name} <br /><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><b>電子郵件地址：</b></b> {!Contact.Email} </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 21.3333px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 21.3333px; width: 701.333px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span><b></b></span></b></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="color: #666666;"><b>所需動作</b></span></b></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="color: #666666;"><b></b></span></b></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://signin.intel.com!%ActivationURL%!&amp;culture=en&amp;target=https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/my-intel/developer-sign-in.html">驗證您的電子郵件</a></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 67px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 67px; width: 701.333px;">
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">請點按上方的連結或將此 URL 複製到瀏覽器，以驗證您的電子郵件地址。此連結將在 5 天內過期，並需要您以使用者名稱及密碼重新申請另一電子郵件驗證。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 64px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 64px; width: 701.333px;">
<p style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">請確實保護您的密碼，不要外洩。您使用密碼和  Intel 網站時，必須遵守 Intel 的使用條款。各網站網頁最下方均有使用條款的連結。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 21px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 21px; width: 701.333px;">
<p style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span>如有任何疑問，請</span><u><span style="color: #0070c0;"><a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/forms/support/my-intel-sign-on-support.html">與我們聯絡。</a></span></u></span></p>
<p c="" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><u><span style="color: #0070c0;"></span></u></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span>若要管理您的個人檔案，包括可用的行銷訂閱，請造訪</span> <u><span style="color: #0070c0;"><span style="color: #0000ff;"><a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/secure/my-intel/profile.html" style="color: #0000ff;">My Intel</a></span>。</span></u></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 21px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 21px; width: 701.333px;"></td>
</tr>
<tr id="disclaimer" style="height: 42px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 42px; width: 701.333px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">請勿回覆此電子郵件訊息。此郵件是系統自動傳送。<br />為確保能繼續收到我們的電子郵件，請將我們加到您的通訊錄。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 17px; width: 701.333px;">
<div align="center" style="text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center" /></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 55px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 55px; width: 701.333px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><img alt="Intel 圖誌" src="http://www.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/myIntelLogo.jpg" align="right" /> <span>Intel 承諾保護您的隱私權。如需更多資訊，<br />請參閱 <a href="http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/privacy/intel-online-privacy-notice-summary.html"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Intel 隱私權聲明。</span></a> </span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 64px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 10.5pt 33pt; height: 64px; width: 701.333px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/terms-of-use.html?iid=ftr%20terms"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">法律聲明</span></a> &verbar; <a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/trademarks.html"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">商標</span></a> &copy; Intel Corporation。版權所有。<br />*其他名稱與品牌可能業經宣告為他人之財產。<br />**Intel 對本公司內部網路以外的網站內容概不負責。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 42px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 10.5pt 33pt; height: 42px; width: 701.333px;">
<p style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">!%TemplateCode%!</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>